Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,«Somebody That I Used To Know»
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.35,0:00:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now and then I think of when we were together\N♪ 偶尔我会想起我们在一起的时光 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.18,0:00:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Like when you said you felt so happy you could die\N♪ 就像你曾说你幸福到仿佛可以死去 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.02,0:00:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Told myself that you were right for me\N♪ 我曾告诉自己你就是对的人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.66,0:00:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But felt so lonely in your company\N♪ 但在你身边却感到如此孤独 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.93,0:00:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But that was love and it's an ache I still remember\N♪ 但那正是爱 是我至今记得的痛 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.57,0:01:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You can get addicted to a certain kind of sadness\N♪ 你会沉迷于某种悲伤 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.54,0:01:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Like resignation to the end, always the end\N♪ 就像无奈接受结局 永远都是结束 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.09,0:01:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So when we found that we could not make sense\N♪ 所以当我们发现无法继续 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.94,0:01:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well you said that we would still be friends\N♪ 你说我们仍可以做朋友 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.90,0:01:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll admit that I was glad it was over\N♪ 但我得承认 我很高兴结束了 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.14,0:01:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But you didn't have to cut me off\N♪ 但你没必要彻底切断联系 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.10,0:01:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Make out like it never happened\N♪ 装作一切从未发生 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.84,0:01:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And that we were nothing\N♪ 仿佛我们不曾有过什么 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.14,0:01:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't even need your love\N♪ 我甚至不需要你的爱 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.31,0:01:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But you treat me like a stranger\N♪ 但你却待我如陌生人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.99,0:01:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And that feels so rough\N♪ 这感觉如此伤人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.75,0:01:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to stoop so low\N♪ 你没必要如此不堪 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.08,0:01:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Have your friends collect your records\N♪ 让朋友来取走你的唱片 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.69,0:01:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And then change your number\N♪ 然后换了你的电话号码 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.61,0:01:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that I don't need that though\N♪ 我想我也不需要这些了 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.31,0:02:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're just somebody that I used to know\N♪ 如今你只是我曾认识的某人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.51,0:02:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're just somebody that I used to know\N♪ 如今你只是我曾认识的某人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.99,0:02:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're just somebody that I used to know\N♪ 如今你只是我曾认识的某人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.24,0:02:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now and then I think of all the times you screwed me over\N♪ 偶尔我会想起你一次次辜负我的时刻 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.06,0:02:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But had me believing it was always something that I'd done\N♪ 却让我相信一切都是我的过错 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.42,0:02:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't wanna live that way\N♪ 我不想那样活着 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Reading into every word you say\N♪ 揣测你说的每个字 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.66,0:02:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You said that you could let it go\N♪ 你说过你能放下一切 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.93,0:03:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't catch you hung up on somebody that you used to know\N♪ 而我也不会发现你还牵挂着曾认识的某人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.95,0:03:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But you didn't have to cut me off\N♪ 但你没必要彻底切断联系 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.20,0:03:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Make out like it never happened\N♪ 装作一切从未发生 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.52,0:03:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And that we were nothing\N♪ 仿佛我们不曾有过什么 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.60,0:03:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't even need your love\N♪ 我甚至不需要你的爱 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.10,0:03:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But you treat me like a stranger\N♪ 但你却待我如陌生人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.94,0:03:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And that feels so rough\N♪ 这感觉如此伤人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.68,0:03:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to stoop so low\N♪ 你没必要如此不堪 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.23,0:03:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Have your friends collect your records\N♪ 让朋友来取走你的唱片 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.75,0:03:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And then change your number\N♪ 然后换了你的电话号码 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.65,0:03:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that I don't need that though\N♪ 我想我也不需要这些了 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.29,0:03:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're just somebody that I used to know\N♪ 如今你只是我曾认识的某人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.60,0:03:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're just somebody that I used to know\N♪ 如今你只是我曾认识的某人 ♪
